@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Restaurants - all, paginated
GET {{base}}/restaurants

### Static route before dynamic route
GET {{base}}/restaurants/open

### Filter restaurants
GET {{base}}/restaurants?area=Bole&limit=10

### Restaurant member
GET {{base}}/restaurants/1

### Restaurant dishes - sub-resource
GET {{base}}/restaurants/1/dishes

### Missing parent restaurant - 404
GET {{base}}/restaurants/99/dishes

### Dishes - all, paginated
GET {{base}}/dishes

### Dishes for restaurant 1
GET {{base}}/dishes?restaurantId=1

### Orders - all, paginated
GET {{base}}/orders

### Pending orders - static route
GET {{base}}/orders/pending

### Orders for restaurant 1
GET {{base}}/restaurants/1/orders

### Create an order
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Beza",
  "area": "Bole",
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "totalSantim": 45000
}

### Change order status
PATCH {{base}}/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "preparing"
}

### Delete order - 204 empty response
DELETE {{base}}/orders/14
